@startuml

[*] -> GetEquations
GetEquations -down-> NeighborSolver

NeighborSolver -down-> NeighborSolver : MadeChanges
NeighborSolver -down-> SubSetSolver : MadeNoChanges
SubSetSolver -up-> NeighborSolver : MadeChanges
SubSetSolver -down-> EnumerationSolver : MadeNoChanges
EnumerationSolver -up-> NeighborSolver : MadeChanges
EnumerationSolver -down-> [*] : MadeNoChanges

@enduml